NMR (300 MHz, CDCl3): δ 6.92 (d, 1H, J = 2.4 Hz, H-1'), 5.80-5.83 (m, 1H,
H-2'), 5.72-5.76 (m, 1H, H-3'), 4.43-4.46 (m, 2H, H-4' + H-5'), 4.12-4.19
(m, 1H, H-5'), 4.01 (s, 3H, -OCH3), 2.47 (br, 1H, -OH), 2.14 (s, 3H,
-C(O)CH3), 2.12 (s, 3H, -C(O)CH3), 2.08 (s, 3H, -C(O)CH3), 1.99-2.05 (m,
4H, cyclopentanyl- H), 1.75-1.87 (m, 4H, cyclopentanyl-H). 13C NMR (75
MHz, CDCl3): δ 170.9, 169.8, 169.6, 157.6, 147.7, 145.1, 95.5, 89.7,
80.9, 74.6, 74.4, 73.2, 71.0, 63.0, 53.8, 42.3, 23.7, 20.9, 20.7.
