$DATUM Colorless oil, yield 80.1 mg, 79%. HPLC: t = 6.62 min, purity greater
than 99% (method 1); t = 6.39 min, purity 95.3% (method 2). 1H NMR (300
MHz, CDCl3): δ 6.93 (d, 1H, J = 1.5 Hz, H-1'), 5.80-5.83 (m, 1H, H-2'),
5.74-5.77 (m, 1H, H-3'), 4.43-4.47 (m, 2H, H-4' + H-5'), 4.13-4.19 (m,
1H, H-5'), 4.02 (s, 3H, -OCH3), 2.24 (br, 1H, -OH), 2.14 (s, 3H,
-C(O)CH3), 2.12 (s, 3H, -C(O)CH3), 2.08 (s, 3H, -C(O)CH3), 2.02-2.05 (m,
2H, cyclohexanyl-H), 1.65-1.78 (m, 8H, cyclohexane-H). 13C NMR (75 MHz,
CDCl3): δ 170.9, 169.8, 169.6, 157.6, 147.7, 145.0, 95.4, 89.6, 80.9,
74.5, 71.0, 68.8, 63.0, 62.9, 53.8, 42.3, 39.5, 25.2, 23.7, 23.2, 20.9,
20.7. Maldi-MS: m/z 530.2 [M + Na]+. HRMS: calcd for C23H29N3O10Na+
530.1745, found 530.1740. IR: 2236.7 cm-1.
